aether.desc.sky=Soft painted colours in the sky: golden and blue hours, a pastel horizon. 0 keeps Radiante PT's sky.
aether.desc.sky_light=How much of the painted colour tints the light the sky casts on the world. Higher tints it more.
aether.desc.round_discs=A round sun with a darker rim, and a moon with its phase and seas, in place of the square ones.
aether.desc.sun_size=Size of the round sun and moon. Higher is larger.
aether.desc.corona=Soft glow round the sun and a faint halo round the moon. 0 turns them off.
aether.desc.end_sky=An indigo End sky with drifting nebulae and faint stars, and fog to match. 0 keeps Radiante PT's.
aether.desc.stars=Brightness of the coloured, twinkling stars that replace Radiante PT's. 0 brings those back.
aether.desc.milky_way=Brightness of the milky way and the nebula glow round it. 0 turns them off.
aether.desc.night_glow=How much the milky way lights the world at night. Higher is brighter; 0 turns its light off.
aether.desc.clouds=Soft drifting clouds with silver linings and moving shadows. Off: none (choose Radiante's own clouds again in its settings).
aether.desc.cloud_cover=How much of the sky the clouds cover. Rain and thunder add more.
aether.desc.cirrus=High wispy streaks that catch the sunset. 0 turns them off.
aether.desc.cloud_shadows=How dark the clouds' shadows on the ground are. 0 turns them off.
aether.desc.cloud_speed=How fast the clouds drift. 0 stops them.
aether.desc.haze=Haze in the air, thicker and golden with a low sun, for god rays. Needs Volumetric Light. 0 turns it off.
aether.desc.valley_mist=Mist while you are low down, in rain and on calm mornings. Needs Volumetric Light. 0 turns it off.
aether.desc.nether_haze=How thick the Nether's haze is. 1 is Radiante PT's; higher is thicker and warmer.
aether.desc.sun_warmth=Warm sunlight and cool moonlight. 0 keeps Radiante PT's colours.
aether.desc.leaf_light=Sunlight shining through leaves and grass from behind. Higher is brighter; 0 turns it off.
aether.desc.torch_warmth=Warmer torches and lanterns, colder soul fire. 0 keeps Radiante PT's colours.
aether.desc.wetness=How wet the ground stays after rain: darker and glossier. 0 leaves only Radiante PT's rain.
aether.desc.puddles=How far puddles spread on wet open ground. 0 turns them off.
aether.desc.water_tint=Turquoise shallows and teal depths. 0 keeps Radiante PT's water colour.
aether.desc.water_clarity=How far you see through water. Higher is clearer.
aether.desc.water_calm=Smaller, slower, longer waves for glassy water. Storms still roughen it.
aether.desc.underwater_warp=A gentle waver, shimmer and dark edges with the camera under water. 0 turns them off.
aether.desc.grade=Film colour: warm highlights, teal shadows, soft contrast. 0 leaves the picture as it is.
aether.desc.bloom=A soft glow round bright things. Higher is stronger.
aether.desc.streak=A horizontal lens streak from the sun and bright lamps. 0 turns it off.
aether.desc.vignette=Darker corners. Higher is darker.
aether.desc.aberration=Red and blue fringes towards the edges of the screen. 0 turns them off.

aether.preset.aether=Aether
aether.preset.aether.desc=The pack's own look.
aether.preset.golden=Golden
aether.preset.golden.desc=Warmer light, thicker golden haze, a bigger sun and glow, more cirrus.
aether.preset.moody=Moody
aether.preset.moody.desc=Heavier clouds, more mist and puddles, rougher water, darker corners.
aether.preset.clean=Clean
aether.preset.clean.desc=A lighter touch: a subtle sky and grade, no streak or fringes.
